        "abstract": "A detailed study has been made of the land mobile service frequency congestion situation in the New York City area. The conclusion is reached that the 150 Mc band is saturated and that the 450 Mc band will also be saturated in the middle 1970's. Suggestions are made for improved frequency management methods. However, even with such improved management, it is shown that additional allocations are needed.",
